@Pixel-Therapy,
Correct me if I am wrong but, From this [TF Link](https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python/tf/random/uniform) and [The Source Code](https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/r2.0/tensorflow/python/ops/random_ops.py#L186-L252),  it is mentioned that `random.uniform()` returns a Tensor but it is not mentioned that it will be a Scalar Tensor.

Can you please provide the reference where it mentions `random.uniform` returns a Scalar Tensor. Thanks!
